Package: fakehosp
Title: Synthetic Acute Hospital Data Generator (Fake NHS Trust)
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Claude", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@anthropic.com")
Description: Seeded, reproducible generator for the Fake NHS Trust synthetic
    dataset: PAS ADT events, ED attendances, outpatients and RTT, radiology
    (CT, MRI, ultrasound) and endoscopy, written as layer-1 source extracts.
    See docs/DESIGN.md in the repository.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: data.table (>= 1.14), jsonlite, checkmate
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.0
